// Variable Group - depends_on_Victim Var Name - MYSTERY_VICTIM_FACT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MYSTERY_VICTIM_FACT :
"P2911470608" "Maurer was trying to bridge the gap between Hero and Villain."
// MYSTERY_VICTIM_FACT :
"P166393014" "Kay was the first to establish relationship with some of the islands controlled by Lord Recluse."
// MYSTERY_VICTIM_FACT :
"P3753479533" "Min, has a track record of getting to the bottom of a matter, regardless of who gets in his way."
// MYSTERY_VICTIM_FACT :
"P2561288991" "The Ambassador is nice enough I guess. He always seemed a little uptight to me. Didn't have a lot of friends."
// MYSTERY_VICTIM_FACT :
"P2502223053" "Alvarado apparently went toe to toe with Recluse at one point, not with fists, but with words. They guy's got a pair, that's for sure."
// MYSTERY_VICTIM_FACT :
"P49507397" "Ambassador Austin was well respected by the community. I don't understand why anyone would want to do this."
// MYSTERY_VICTIM_FACT :
"P2087299002" "They called him the Hawk, you know. They guy could get you to agree to just about anything. It looks like, someone was immune to his silver tongue."

