// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Investigate4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Investigate4 :
"P3697402644" "As a hero, you always thought you'd catch the bad guys, you just never thought you've have to actually investigate the crime first. To think, from all that fighting all you learned was"

