// Investigate5 :
"P2874309150" "Well, at the start of this, you knew {MYSTERY_VICTIM_NAME} wasn't killed by wild monkeys with a large stick while standing on the Serengeti. Thankfully, your instincts hold true now that you know"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Investigate6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Investigate6 :
"P496044552" "{MYSTERY_VICTIM_NAME} was well connected. The last guy in there told you"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Investigate7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Investigate7 :
"P1612734260" "Piece by piece you put this together. Today, you figured out"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Investigate8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Investigate8 :
