// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P929161671" "{MYSTERY_VICTIM_NAME} was murdered. This is bad. {MYSTERY_VICTIM_FACT}. His death is gonig to ripple through Paragon. We just started investigating it and already, things are looking deep. He was connected, more than I think anyone ever knew. I think we need our help on this. The deeper we get, the scarier the suspects get, Dr. Aeon, Sirrocco even Ghost Widow to name a few. Yeah, this is big, bigger than me, maybe even bigger than you...<br><br>What do you say, you up for solving a little mystery?"
// AcceptString :
"P1816242686" "{ACCEPT_STRING}"
// SendOffString :
"P3047046399" "That's a load off my shoulders. So, here's how this is going to work. I've got a handful of leads that need to be investigated. Come see me and I'll give you the lead. You'll go and check it out and learned more about this case. As we narrow down the suspects, the locations and the method {MYSTERY_VICTIM_NAME} was killed, you'll be able to make an accusation. For an accusation, we're going to round up all the suspects and take them to the crime scene. There you'll reveal how you think the crime was commited. I'd recommend you get your facts straight before you make an accusation though. These people don't much like being pulled out of their day to day lives for no good reason.<br><br>I should also mention that you're deally with killers here, well at least one of them killed for sure. If you're correct in accusing them, they're going to want a piece of you. Be prepared."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1731910804" "{ACTIVE_TASK_STRING}"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2964025986" "{YOURE_STILL_BUSY}"
